Apple is working to revamp <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/homekit/">HomeKit</a> amid a new push into the smart home market, according to <a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-30/apple-is-finally-ready-to-enter-its-next-big-category-the-smart-home"><em>Bloomberg</em>'s Mark Gurman</a>. <br/>
